      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed benefit is bounded to 1–3 wt% SiC, inert-atmosphere sintering, extended liquid-bath exposure, and absence of detrimental secondary phases.",
